---
// Home page — spec 2026-08-20-southleft-example-app, T3 + T5/T6/T8, REBUILT
// T9 round 2 for section-by-section structural parity with v5's real
// src/pages/index.astro: same section order, same copy/data, same defaults.
// Not reproduced (bespoke, no al-* equivalent — see verification notes):
// GenerativeCanvas (hero background canvas), TokenPlayground, Marquee, the
// draggable hero token chips, and the terminal panel. Everything else —
// content, IA, section order, section designs — is transcribed.
//
// `data-section-id` on each top-level <section> is the layout resolver's
// (src/lib/layout-resolver.ts, T5) reorder target — the AI direction panel
// (T6) can permute logos/services/work/testimonials/insights/cta live. The
// hero is deliberately NOT one of them (always first, by construction — see
// that module's doc comment), and the footer lives outside <main> entirely
// (Base.astro), so it is always last regardless of what a layout carries.
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ArticleCard from '../components/ArticleCard.astro';
